damaged_code:
```cpp
struct UnalignedData {
    char padding;
    std::atomic<int32_t> val; // Straddles cache-line boundary!
} __attribute__((packed));
```

fix:
Remove packing from around atomic types to let the compiler enforce natural alignment.
```cpp
struct AlignedData {
    char padding;
    // Align to natural boundary
    alignas(4) std::atomic<int32_t> val; 
};
```
